{"id":"vod_bf_24009","vodId":"24009","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"某科学的超电磁炮第一季","name_cn":"某科学的超电磁炮第一季","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-25/23f649c756d70c25690d9249522b2f08.jpg"},"summary":"本剧以镰池和马所著的轻小说《魔法禁书目录》中的人气角色御坂美琴为主角的外传漫画《科学超电磁炮》改编。　　故事发生在面积占据东京都西部的三分之一，居住着230万名人口，其中八成人口是学生的巨大都市“学园都市”。学园都市和外部隔离，研究最尖端科技。所有学生都接受超能力开发，并大都借由药物、催眠术与通电刺激等方式取得超能力。有各种类型不同能力，以范围和威力分为无能力者（Level 0）、低能力者（Level 1）、异能力者（Level 2）、强能力者（Level 3）、大能力者（Level 4）和超能力者（Level5）。故事从学园都市最强的电击公主“超电磁炮”御坂美琴，某天认识了和黑子一样担任风纪委员的初春饰利开始......","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 17:50:41","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/moukexuedechaodiancipaodiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241204aaJv1ydrindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf4.com/video/moukexuedechaodiancipaodiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241204wcwORnNDindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/202412047AejXKWjindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241204h7ZWjiyVindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/moukexuedechaodiancipaodiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241204qr2oq0DMindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/moukexuedechaodiancipaodiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241204svT4uyimindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241204zRvm